    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d439">

                <pb facs="0406" n="290" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg290"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 322.112G64/4.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister of Ecuador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 14.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt of your note of December 17, stating
                    that in your conference with the Counselor of the Department on the same day, it
                    was agreed that in the case of the Chinese, Goo Kwai, who entered Ecuador in
                    violation of the regulations which exclude Chinese from its territory, the laws
                    of Ecuador must be obeyed, but that he would nevertheless be granted the favor
                    of remaining in that country until the last day of this month, to visit his
                    friends. You add that you have advised your Government of this agreement, and
                    ask the Department to inform the American Minister at Quito of it.</p>
                <p>In reply I beg to say that on December 28 the Minister at Quito was informed by
                    telegraph of the agreement reached.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
